---
import {
	Layers as LayersIcon,
	Link2 as Link2Icon,
	Mail as MailIcon,
	ShieldCheck as ShieldCheckIcon,
	Terminal as TerminalIcon,
	TriangleAlert as TriangleAlertIcon,
} from "@lucide/astro";
---

<!-- Key Features Grid (Engineered, No AI Slop) -->
<section id="features" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-slate-800">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
			<span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">Engineering Highlights</span>
			<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-2">
				Built for reliability, privacy, and zero overhead
			</h2>
			<p class="text-slate-300 mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed">
				Engineered as a clean Windows utility using CustomTkinter and Playwright. Every feature is designed with practical desktop integration in mind.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
			<!-- Feature 1 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<LayersIcon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Intelligent Multi-Browser Cascade</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					No Python or manual browser downloads required. Intelligently cascades across Google Chrome, native Microsoft Edge, Brave Browser, Opera, and Vivaldi already on your system, avoiding 400MB bundled downloads.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 2 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<ShieldCheckIcon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">100% Local &amp; Private</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					No cloud relays, proxies, or remote APIs. Session records, demographic profiles, and output URLs are written strictly to the local
					<code class="text-slate-300 font-mono text-xs">results/</code> folder on your drive and never transmitted externally.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 3 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<Link2Icon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Canonical Link Extraction</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Unwraps session tokens and authentication redirection wrappers to deliver a clean, permanent
					<span class="text-sky-300 font-medium">official Google One offer link</span> that can be redeemed anytime in your browser.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 4 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<MailIcon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Dual Delivery Architecture</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Handles direct on-screen promotional offers as well as accounts where the partner dispatches activation emails directly to the inbox, providing clear status guidance for both paths.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 5 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<TriangleAlertIcon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Smart Error &amp; Challenge Safety</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Proactively detects Cloudflare Turnstile, reCAPTCHA, and gateway stops. Safely pauses execution with clear on-screen diagnostics to protect accounts from lockouts.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Feature 6 -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">
				<div
					class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
				>
					<TerminalIcon class="w-5 h-5" />
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2">Built-in Diagnostics (F12)</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
					Includes an integrated testing suite (<kbd
						class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 font-mono text-xs"
						>F12</kbd
					>) allowing developers to simulate verification flows, gateway responses, and link extraction states safely.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
